extends ../../webinc/html/disease.jade

block head
    title Bleeding Gums - Plants Cause Disease

block content
    h1 Bleeding Gums
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/symptoms/24908-bleeding-gums") Cleveland Clinic]:
    blockquote Buildup of dental plaque causes bleeding gums, a common symptom of gingivitis, periodontitis and other forms of gums disease. But bleeding from your gums can also indicate other issues like teeth grinding, diabetes, hormone fluctuations and vitamin deficiencies.
